---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import PageFooter from '../components/PageFooter.astro';
import Medallion from '../components/Medallion.astro';
import Ornament from '../components/Ornament.astro';
import Tailpiece from '../components/Tailpiece.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="CIRWEL Systems — Infrastructure for continuous agent work"
  description="UNITARES keeps identity, evidence, decisions, and next steps connected as work moves across people, processes, and systems."
>
  <PageHeader currentPath="/" />

  <main class="px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-screen-xl mx-auto">
    <section class="pt-16 pb-24 lg:pt-28 lg:pb-32 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-10">
        <p class="label text-oxblood mb-8">Infrastructure for work that continues</p>
        <h1 class="display text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl !leading-[1.08] mb-10 max-w-5xl">
          Carry the thread.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-ink max-w-3xl">
          People and software agents hand work across prompts, processes, machines, and organizations. UNITARES preserves who acted, what they learned, what evidence they carried, and what should happen next.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone max-w-3xl mt-6">
          It is a shared accountability layer beside the tools and models you already use—not another agent framework and not a replacement for human judgment.
        </p>
        <nav aria-label="Start with UNITARES" class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-4">
          <a href="/ecosystem#handoff" class="label text-oxblood no-underline hover:underline">See one handoff →</a>
          <a href="/build" class="label text-oxblood no-underline hover:underline">Run UNITARES →</a>
        </nav>
        <Ornament size="floret" class="mt-12 opacity-80" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="handoff" class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-y border-sepia/50">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4"><p class="label text-oxblood">I · One thread of work</p><Medallion roman="I" class="hidden lg:block mt-7" /></div>
        <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8">
          <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-tight mb-5">A handoff without amnesia.</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-stone leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">The useful unit is not a chat session. It is the work that continues through changing actors and runtimes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ol class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
        <li class="border-t border-oxblood pt-5">
          <p class="label text-oxblood mb-4">I · Direct</p>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">A person sets the work in motion.</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">The objective, authority, constraints, and initial evidence enter the record with their source intact.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="border-t border-oxblood pt-5">
          <p class="label text-oxblood mb-4">II · Act</p>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">A software process does the work.</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Claims, tests, decisions, and discoveries remain attributable to the process that produced them.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="border-t border-oxblood pt-5">
          <p class="label text-oxblood mb-4">III · Continue</p>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">The next agent can proceed.</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">A successor receives provenance, open questions, evidence, and the next useful action instead of reconstructing the work from fragments.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="label text-oxblood mb-4">II · What remains connected</p>
        <Medallion roman="II" class="hidden lg:block mt-7 mb-8" />
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">Enough structure to understand and continue.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-12">
        <article>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">Identity and lineage</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Actions are bound to process identity. Continuity and delegation are declared, so a familiar name never substitutes for attribution.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">Evidence and outcomes</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Claims can carry tests, observations, reviews, and later outcomes without losing where each piece came from.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">Shared understanding</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Agents can recover durable findings, disagreements, and decisions without treating chat history as collective memory.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">Reason and next action</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Every policy response names its reason and a next step. The purpose is informed progress, with intervention reserved for boundaries that require it.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-y border-sepia/50 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4"><p class="label text-oxblood">III · Available now</p><Medallion roman="III" class="hidden lg:block mt-7" /></div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8">
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-tight mb-8">Open, self-hosted, and client-neutral.</h2>
        <dl class="space-y-6 max-w-3xl">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 border-t border-sepia/40 pt-5">
            <dt class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-3 label text-stone">Server</dt>
            <dd class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-9"><a href="https://github.com/cirwel/unitares" class="font-medium">CIRWEL/unitares</a> <span class="text-stone">· Apache 2.0 · MCP and REST</span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 border-t border-sepia/40 pt-5">
            <dt class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-3 label text-stone">Client contract</dt>
            <dd class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-9"><a href="https://pypi.org/project/unitares-sdk/" class="font-mono text-sm">unitares-sdk</a> <span class="text-stone">· identity, evidence, memory, policy, and coordination</span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 border-t border-sepia/40 pt-5">
            <dt class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-3 label text-stone">Research</dt>
            <dd class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-9"><a href="/research" class="font-medium">Questions, evidence, and current understanding</a></dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="py-20 lg:py-28 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="label text-oxblood mb-5">Begin</p>
      <h2 class="display text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-tight mb-7">Give the next agent somewhere solid to stand.</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-4">
        <a href="/build" class="label text-oxblood no-underline hover:underline">Build on UNITARES →</a>
        <a href="mailto:founder@cirwel.org" class="label text-oxblood no-underline hover:underline">Talk with CIRWEL →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <Tailpiece class="pb-14 opacity-80" />
  </main>

  <PageFooter />
</BaseLayout>
